    narr:narration """The [two-o'clock half-price switch](narr:Expr_20261009_3_Batch2Bakery20261009050853_hff9ef5f7293e_1) argues discounting at mid-afternoon rather than close, so buyers remain; the [synchronized shelf-card change](narr:Expr_20261009_3_Batch2Bakery20261009050853_hff9ef5f7293e_2) pairs the price move with signage updated at the same hour, keeping the till free of surprises.""" ;
